 "checklist": [
  "Relay shield: power 5V/GND, touch D1 to 3V3: it should click and its LED light.",
  "Meter COM–NO: open with the shield unpowered, closed when D1 is high. Do this before any mains wiring.",
  "SSR input polarity: 3 (+) to GPIO26, 4 (−) to GND.",
  "Mains (C14, K1 terminals, SSR AC side) never on the protoboard.",
  "Sensors on 3V3 only, never 5V.",
  "Bench test with a lamp before the heat panel."
 ],
 "notes": [
  "SDA/SCL are shared by the OLED, SHT30 and IR sensor (I2C at 50 kHz); their boards supply the pull-ups. The DS18B20 adapters carry their own 4.7k pull-ups.",
  "An optional upstream failsafe (ZEN04 or ITC-308) plugs in between the wall and the C14 cord; see BUILD.md."
 ]
}